{
  "_README": [
    "Chain profiles for scripts/scan.js and scripts/flashloan-check.js.",
    "",
    "The base token of every chain is its WRAPPED GAS TOKEN (WETH on Base and",
    "Arbitrum, WBNB on BNB Chain). Arbitrage denominated in the gas token means",
    "profit and gas are the same unit, so the break-even test is exact.",
    "",
    "Only chains with TWO OR MORE fee-tier Uniswap-V3-style DEXes appear here.",
    "That is the binding constraint for this bot: Algebra-based DEXes (Camelot,",
    "QuickSwap, THENA) key pools on (tokenA, tokenB) with no fee argument, and",
    "Aerodrome Slipstream keys on tickSpacing, so neither is a drop-in venue.",
    "",
    "VERIFY EVERY ADDRESS against official docs before sending real funds.",
    "scan.js checks each address has code and that resolved token symbols match",
    "these keys, but it cannot prove an address is the official deployment.",
    "Uniswap V3: https://docs.uniswap.org/contracts/v3/reference/deployments",
    "PancakeSwap V3: https://developer.pancakeswap.finance/contracts/v3/addresses",
    "Aave V3: https://aave.com/docs/resources/addresses"
  ],

